              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Akanena hivi, Huyo mnyama wa nne atakuwa ni ufalme wa nne juu ya dunia, utakaokuwa mbali na falme zile zote, nao utaangamiza dunia yote, na kuikanyaga, na kuivunja vipande vipande. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DAN.7.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
