        },
        {
          "text": " Naye atanena maneno kinyume chake Aliye Juu, naye atawadhoofisha watakatifu wake Aliye Juu; naye ataazimu kubadili majira na sheria; nao watatiwa mikononi mwake kwa nyakati tatu na nusu ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DAN.7.25",
